<title>BRAZIL: Brazil July sugar exports ex-CS ports down on 1996.</title>
<headline>Brazil July sugar exports ex-CS ports down on 1996.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil sugar shipments out of key ports in the center-south region reached 623,402 tonnes in July, over 11 percent down on the 705,326 tonnes shipped in July last year, according to port statistics.</p>
<p>Santos was the top sugar exporting port with total shipments of 371,577 tonnes but was below the 497,894 tonnes exported from the port in July 1996.</p>
<p>In the first three months of the crop year however, overall shipments are still above last year at 1.18 million tonnes against 1.11 million tonnes in May to July 1996.</p>
